---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<div class="tui-window blue-168 tui-page-window">
		<fieldset class="tui-fieldset white-255-border">
			<legend class="white-255-text">About Me</legend>
			<p class="white-255-text">
				<a href="/" class="cyan-255-text">&larr; Back to Home</a>
			</p>
			<p class="white-255-text">
				I am a Senior Frontend Engineer and Frontend Architect with over a decade of experience
				designing, building, and modernizing enterprise-grade web applications. Throughout my career,
				I have specialized in frontend architecture, TypeScript, design systems, and schema-driven UI.
				I am passionate about bridging the gap between complex engineering requirements and intuitive
				user experiences, having successfully led efforts to replace legacy systems, deliver greenfield
				platforms, and scale engineering teams in complex enterprise environments.
			</p>
			<p class="white-255-text">
				Outside of my core engineering work, I believe in maintaining a balanced lifestyle that fuels
				creativity and discipline. I am an avid photographer, capturing narratives through visual media,
				and a dedicated boxer, which provides both physical challenge and mental focus. I also enjoy
				exploring game design and interactive systems during my downtime.
			</p>
			<p class="white-255-text">
				I thrive on solving complex technical challenges and collaborating with cross-functional teams
				to build products that last. Whether defining architecture, mentoring developers, or writing
				clean, modular code, I focus on delivering scalable, high-performance solutions.
			</p>
		</fieldset>
	</div>

	<div class="tui-window black-168 tui-page-window">
		<fieldset class="tui-fieldset white-168-border">
			<legend class="white-168-text">Photos</legend>
			<div class="image-gallery">
				<img src="/images/arron-taking-a-photo.jpg" alt="Arron McCrory taking a photograph" />
				<img src="/images/arron-boxing.jpg" alt="Arron McCrory boxing" />
				<img src="/images/arron-cider-mill.jpg" alt="Arron McCrory enjoying some hot cider" />
			</div>
		</fieldset>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.image-gallery {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}
	.image-gallery img {
		max-width: 100%;
		border: 2px solid rgb(168, 168, 168);
	}
</style>
